### Variables
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7144
@adminEmail = adminer@smartoffice.com
@adminPassword = Admin1234!

### Login Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

